{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1319,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17d3b603ef4853538e31b779",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この季節は温かなお紅茶で…\r\n寒さなんてギッタンギッタンに\r\nのしてやりますわっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2ec49f838ebb6cfec3176f60c9e7b244dfb461a59cf74acaf6b8e601d7e6292",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8c4867c0541560d9ba74a0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90fb267b322b30d56f1526bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6649de72d36335db2cf3fac8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我曾被冠上……\r\n「当心猛女」这种绰号呢。\r\n已经是很久以前的事了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53a8944b216c056aad68e276dda4b010ff495747855b222afa6538da92f5c711",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86e2607f4a3c007c54bf4c6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊……圣王无论是\r\n外貌还是内在都很完美，\r\n真的是一流的呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "736a6d4922b03fa0646075a74157aab2d634dd4eeb7c0a2cb86ad575a0166b2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5bcd0823c2e32825c4fd24c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爱犬赛巴斯钦\r\n也是公主的绝佳搭档！\r\n……虽然现在还很调皮有待学习。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd1fee023ff58e2557d87826ca2902bc1534433b10c4652f06ef5b245fa7ddfd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bbf01742dc3c7d9b8638eb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是我也拿鬼怪没辄……\r\n毕竟很可怕又摸不着，\r\n无法将它打飞啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cc817c4406aff1a86fd1191a20186dc02594ea0260c7685e4dfb8919c57d202",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66d3081c10a13f1e98039cea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赤骥的三后冠\r\n非常可爱又漂亮～！\r\n很有公主的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "588d2ad5b7c9f57cce9b4aea172f64a2d0fa7b57029bd334a9e9c325e8acd750",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26881f17c5b2c37d42b21210",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要在演唱会\r\n唱公主战士的主题曲？\r\n最后在背后来个爆炸特效结尾！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8f10c856ecb1d3a652a5007cde52b87f484de785bba2bb84b5d97bf613475e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2241422446081196d3cb0fb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和他人同台的演唱会很困难呢～\r\n我有好几次\r\n都差点踩到隔壁的脚……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8aa9618abb7afc897ba9f5ecc89dfd48b4656f79c5c0bc0cd92a6488b8dc1bc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81b141aaf2cbc0d8bddac277",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是「理想」的决胜服！\r\n是能衬托公主的服装！",
      "source_fingerprint": "406159ca07a7e9594478b788fba825c8c88082551eb1dee173020f116ff58f9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef7b18badaa11778b98fdf5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在或许能射出公主光束喔！？\r\n要不要去外面试射看看呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "47f27e9de289f4ecb881be414dbafb49ebcae11205fe7426c492ddf329cd64d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbcf9279a76e4dfea4d8ef12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请看看这个公主脸蛋！\r\n昨晚敷了小黄瓜，\r\n变得很有光泽♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "df4977186c5b03d1f60d36413e268ab01a0311034754403837d752c612f94279",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9401b3991e88c871e46600f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也尽情享用了午餐～！\r\n那个滋味，\r\n简直就是公主级的呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8b933bdc47937350015d0879234de4c255a9e19f6d0c6cea7e3fad853ce20a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:011b3764269066eb9d46bc4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今晚要和采珠一起举办公主战士\r\n播映会！她似乎也很喜欢……\r\n守护「世界」的公主喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ac470a4aac3df142e20f18291af0144e4aa40a6e856f7a2d13b60a7c684ef94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c25d67a4a77f36de9ed523e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算被春风带走\r\n也请放心！\r\n我会帅气地前去相助！",
      "source_fingerprint": "512acc72b8bae8f489f582c98e103227c718c02ec7c87e4912f5550687c21205",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db167f6f86e193f859fea913",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到了夏天就会让人回想起\r\n和昆虫【朋友】决斗……\r\n自己还是「虫公主」时的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9488b80f12bc97320014fe4bb25630b923f175eeab85df56797f85598d25ef49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ceae37c425b35d3a85aec25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "烤番薯就交给本公主♪\r\n好好欣赏我为了王子\r\n磨练出来的高超技巧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73f2c4556549c7d33666e8a6c5d2047089a6a96b6f089c0a8b9377dc541722d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6615e0386b35b0d93a12ffda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我决定了……\r\n这个冬天要收集学园里面的雪，\r\n建一座公主的城堡！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be65a43e13f6fe90d2b984568678e4e110130c66243f0521f2bef321bbd5e6e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2259fe9c59d60cc92d3366c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近、ウララさんとプリンセス流\r\n筋トレを実践中ですの！例えば\r\nバーベルの素振り…500回！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2ddddb22fafe824904cb024ff14b1c195f4edf93f5421b6de9696e6b609f9ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10bb6ed425b485b81dee087f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ツルマルさんって道案内が得意で！\r\n先日のプリファイイベントも\r\n引率してくださいましたのっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30c7381b001e7c1a3b89b4d38fe1833df0560aa025b5149460c769e9fcd83947",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdd9907e2f9e8a84c6782fc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『硬め濃いめ多め』…テイオーさん\r\nおすすめカスタムが姫心を掴んで\r\n離しませんの…罪な味ですわ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3e3ceab5c20004b894b035cc3fb71531949f6d898be3daa28e69b6fad84db29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba7bb2ed64704498b24a3d8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キングさんがお茶会に誘って\r\nくれましたの。…次こそカップを\r\n破壊せずに参加してみせますわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "83184ccb1fcd8c7922683207606afce45df9c9e855f7a1e20ea4270619da05ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5915be7ad75dd920c571de9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キングさんに憧れて時々髪を巻いて\r\nみるんですけど…私の直毛が強力で\r\n全然ウェーブがかかりませんの！",
      "source_fingerprint": "47d4b7fd07a307cb25ed94b81eabe383836b29e5127088cbb4ace81de5d6cba3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00c26012a5624bf6bc694e05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "モーニングティーをこぼして\r\nしまいましたの…お袖のシミ\r\n目立ちませんわよねっ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6beaa1efde575ef3a8463557b3722e01aeedb778122168fe2c58f75c17d66642",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e420039c421254d1a7a89eb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お昼は優雅にランチ…人気メニュー\r\nめがけて、プリンセスダッシュ！\r\nぶちかましますわ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d686bdec1f4ce53c85ee99fc8132f451e201f8c5589d6e385dd8a1cf2b15b0b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb316b1461f6a58d0c38f502",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日は公園でちびプリンセスたちと\r\n缶蹴りしたのでくたくたですわ～！\r\nお布団3秒でぐぅしてしまいそう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3216d2b90925aac8f5daac2617aceee660c5720dca323adbc356c321a755658c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffaa3455c65bd35f62dd83b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "素敵な季節ですわね～。花々に蝶が\r\nとまって…かつて虫捕り無双した\r\n日々を思い出しますわ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a09dddbe5f26386cc166b1dabe39546feace2246f70b015d7baf3df9ae960a38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80494c72ac28456bac4ba7c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウララさんと大発見しましたのっ！\r\n向かい風に向かって走れば\r\n涼しい風が2倍浴びられますのよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b9c6d83b2c1d433d2dd9d5ba177ad106670a503cb895dd83ee05672bc5f6542",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e24e92f8c6751e524878f062",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋祭りといえば初代プリファイ！\r\nうちわ争奪盆ダンスバトルは、お涙\r\nちょちょ切れの感動回でしたわ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89721b9e3d45189da15f2a244029f14ee85801a04be0f002e12e92e18efba5a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c77d1e96a469af195c1fda7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寒い時こそ姫の矜持が試されます！\r\n心と体を熱く燃やすため…\r\n限界筋トレ、やったりますわ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af5121ca0b0de7e8d7964dceefb7e5f37c4c5a293b2d7e7a982abc136c3eef6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:571ff1d0307d481abc65afbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私っ、ぽんぽんの強さには\r\n自信アリですわっ！プリファイの\r\nお衣装に憧れて、鍛えましたから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebc01122b6467467e512238c966b6068574759f46a3e0c72b5660a2df4831138",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd934e9d4dfa1ad42f2ab3e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "見てください、このおリボン！！\r\nなんと、なんと、なんとっっ！！\r\nキングさんとお揃いなんですの～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14267cb7ec0696495de3cb1058b7c8a169ad5d189a26975537d9430d41cc5963",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c879840d5e14694cb1842b3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "公主之行，始于足下！\r\n一步一脚印，\r\n不断努力就能成就实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10a494acd5e2afb83a287287c05d9afcd1f89194a2146f8e683c26da6ea2b092",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:257cbe353b4f28476d50edb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いきますわよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "624118d36e3f169166da3eeff290eb266924095da230646e4fd405e79b567186",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96280f3607623dc3e7a4947f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会好好磨练\r\n自己的实力和美貌──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd613ec52a046879cb133043fd77dd1a4027f572c4d65a83e9d13ad2c5861a1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01d2ec3516b2a306a8786c2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始训练了！\r\nReady princess go！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4f00b46d0fed9b01abc3f7a76ee7353a55d1b7acf15829c368801406e2cfcd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f6806632d9e282a2e8d40fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快点快点，训练员！\r\n今天也来尽情\r\n锻炼一番吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd474495771ed587c43be6d716896a8b0f7e5c09c454bdbdc81135c6bd7158b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:286a32794fb4cfd2b8debc0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "两人一起努力加油，\r\n迈向辉煌的「理想」吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2730b236c64c89b6962b6496923d5460c55b03bfe408cef96482353499840520",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55c167f7e9371e6a9d482f06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是怎样的训练都没问题！\r\n你的公主是所向无敌的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbed06d9d95e15c129f410ca16b38e4aa7958c94749451b27ce94fdaf74e7aab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a53f5ff841da6e2b30c8032c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们是命中注定的搭档……\r\n是能够激励彼此的\r\n最佳组合！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9adf782c942d8e585ff1467c358cfe58f134eeef5cca4d3e0a778ee6965fb62f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6bffaf40de2362b2ca43b86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到夏天就是海边！集训！王子！\r\n让人情绪高涨了～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2c031255c0daad178eff89c96e6a76fbad0d442da8e5cad3fd4911bf51d60b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f3ba9e94c3839a1fc3c1172",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プリファイとキングさん…\r\n2人の師匠を持つ私は\r\nきっと最強になれるはず！",
      "source_fingerprint": "293c5122683d30ce097c464b075d7f178e2bcc8288106772f4cb3c7a8ec7dbd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27300572eb3f06f2ce8fc749",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "華麗な舞のごとく…\r\n鋭く！苛烈な足さばき！\r\nごらんに入れますわ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34370bf3093a5e0a6d228c86be4549754b4fdcda709fac19f97491c126f417d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fef406911d55b771fa086d99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "清く激しく勇ましく！\r\n日々鍛錬を行ってこそ三女神さまの\r\n加護も得られるというものですわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa15842a9c25da316c2813aca54ec212b0da7a65a2e27de2ff70f1b7d3784ab4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:328b9e90da76f0e0bfcd584a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニング中も、\r\n常に舞台に立つ気持ちで\r\n挑みますわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe3e856b6286798131c51a382e2024b7fd328bbdda9761ef3e42bacab7ebda78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:591b0dd27a2a463d50b22263",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“想い”と共に引き継いだ衣装…\r\n恥じぬ姿で\r\n駆け抜けるつもりですわっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "716e7459a67429ad186c59795da66d340fd01fe092fc5f437229510234c54ec0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:905ff5a6189a5e6fca6fb4bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いつか伝説の姫とトレーナーに…。\r\n夢の実現に向けて\r\nお互い鍛えまくりましょうっ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "483856d9363dcf8831e41da2ddc13f1bbeaef968aa44edf0c0e6541e47111543",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a74fc5446dc79e8aa22208c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最強の姫の最強の舞…\r\n誰より傍で見てくれなきゃ\r\nバキッ！ですからね？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8e27414b5e0d43b4ae4593c4e334ad4e11db6bc5a86f1397acc0e1ac7ac3f03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5917402bcf19d6f1b59a53a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们已经成为传说了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd0a357ad168bb65cc9ce1139eb0957d9aa703a24fdeb422c067fabec879c7b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b310259c6d4151d663e4150",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的公主之路\r\n还会持续下去～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcc7cadc6066f2f17b17fc16db7e677dedaf97a0b90e9df782a8b27729621603",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec3ad145b4fd58cd1abc2ae4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私の立ったすべての舞台、\r\nずっと覚えていてくださいねっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e0def619740ac59328b5a31fd591fc59188b573cfc8b34c9749e7e819c0c56d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d1ed84ee54925b32c76f0ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姫らしく\r\n華麗で優雅に舞えましたわ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "506bb57e27177286d81db39a211260ed57e2dfb2dc7a5df1e3c081ae38fc682f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67788a8b7c97eebd11149274",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要更像公主……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5048c5a8a709f19592d37235420e926f322b3c7c4bad32e1dca1b16a6e20742",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12f01a7560d2ad35767d222b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "超越极限，\r\n变身──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbe3d3b267507af0d65be74a6cf17e0e12e4df35625a54c7f1c5bbec99130d3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c042b83b0f2a42de10866cf0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你好，\r\n我是川上公主！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8d6a934567456a33c9326f6af7065de4d74bd6ca3b102c661493dc28fdcb710",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35b557a79dd4ac2a6d93960a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身为公主，我会华丽又高雅地──\r\n打趴对手！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4541d413c169162ea548cfd8046b674749bc77cb9ac1b4a57847150aee2f43b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a7eb0979ddc78a0e4d5493e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我感觉充满力量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd8f8a330971c85f7266ff5922e2c414ffc44fa2575f63395d98ec89318db0c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72c970eed1f7b54677918d5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阻止我前进的障碍，我会咚地破除！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5c2b46e896b91817efc1622e4bf2cb08a51528c98fee08aa7c50c7138bd770d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc484480276a4350933a5fb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姫の舞はまだまだこれからでしてよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9ad2ee3470a3e234698b4d1f68f682fd8fc259ae00a109e9aa4b1997ab90cb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38afd8c0e9605e8d349e73a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "より強く、激しく、\r\n舞って参りますわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5578d4ae8f98ae047f134a4a00068523cba0e67de6d9c6264b7b21b3141cbce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95bb80dba2420555c8dd517f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "清らなる姫の舞、バチコーンと\r\n決めてみせますわっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f9e683ecbf1f719ffc722daf5c4d43db4a5352e8d3532e939033eece8c49ba9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c07d26fa28feaf23709ec0db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カワカミプリンセスです！\r\nこの姫っぷり、ごらんあれっ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "634c168c1c43e8c0d13abadc304b23ec097c25b4d9a07b2902a26f8083dc66b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7346864799fc23be473879c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要和大家一起拿下胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38d488e63eb219bd8a1efe666634c1080df2d39c9041d8d655b58f3251cb81e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:153b8598569bfb032d18c1fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是模特还是比赛，现在我必须要\n做到两全其美。经纪人估计血压又会\n升高了吧…但我可不会放弃。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d51131348d3bf1930396b78c0fe550d70e1e369f05698b139997114c47bd72a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94f0d0bfec963b1ef20a9b4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c258c6fbb37905535703e68e2fc288861a7a636980f7eab0cb36dd332608f75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2682ea45f9eccf781bd6b000",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d9f2c221a037f0a2eb9da22145532ea4b422af42c29694227631ad74c073f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b72e792b865ec12c0fbcba34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可别错过了我的轨迹，\n好好注视着我吧。\n…毕竟当初是你拉我入伙的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50c06ad7f3c79d9429367c94d70b7c808f829bb6f8c1c1b5edafd140409a3ca5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a1e5c2ec5adc03182f87556",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是把我跑步的视频传到网上的话…\n大家都吃惊地惊呼『好快？！』吧。\n…呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a20464220d0ed868484867b3bc9100acdb5a529a60dc806da341c0b28fbef06e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38a67f8b43ed4f0cc58651ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你新年快乐。\n…怎么啦？\n我好歹也是会规规矩矩地打招呼的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2f0c06d28065c2625a0d7e40948e1f3f3822ffb1a3ccc2b0c0c50ab64b045ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:052bff10ba33d0d1c8dc2b45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…难道你在期待我送你巧克力吗？\n这做法也太过时了吧…\n哈啊…待会给你吧，待・会！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c5c14c2b8996a3d8c90ba88d2d104bf35b86006468d2ad385249aee9206e57f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adc363638066137c190af564",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛，毕竟也算给你添了不少麻烦，\n就把这个当作是谢礼之类的东西吧。\n…我的真心也好好地加进去了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "980b2ce1038a91911924d8cd962673ab9aa7f9ffa817f9dd179b6c295ec437e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b94c57b0c2f63f93aead73b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向着星星许愿这种事还挺浪漫的。\n不过…我也想相信仅有努力才能\n亲手实现梦想这种说法呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "821d0fc0fa794251ac9186af90c66d704cdd8c3d2db3844eec9f7e74169f9a40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f4525ea56faf63d47193620",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…你在等我的固定台词吗？\n真拿你没办法…就当是特别福利吧。\nTrick or Treat！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3343cad1f501eb02af7ebf61495cc8cb8731fbaf6628d558da7367d0ec902c6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd8f961af8e0dfda650a6777",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。顺便…圣诞快乐。\n不至于这么高兴吧…\n正常地享受节日就可以啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80411f9f430ad1cc3f91938bb112bbae61f4aa7dbe83c24853261c9668db1410",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f406abe385714ae618e6d2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞节啊…\n明明和平时没什么两样，\n但就是感觉很特殊。为什么呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9caffee7e0e62c724196d4381f9a9f8235aaf998368b45af01dfeff5322fb63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:756d4aa0e0e656080c12899f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49672a086a169b187b16a389c63cf25fceada147d32b3aa866520c2b922fd86c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:101d94582016d6768fae7ad3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊…为什么每次一到年初都会这样\n忙得要死啊…\n经纪人也给我接了太多工作了吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "0579558b2320f522a52603723082df5a716680d5f825500be47e5f626d866bc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abd655b61bf7100bbdaa708f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样——等等，你今天生日吧？\n哎？这种事我多少还是记得的。\n姑且祝贺一下吧。生日快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "47a1a0e877fe2d3080c343cfa24b852b4779564d6076de4f782dcd70b2e61e35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:874239595a195f261816fa55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐。\n那么作为生日礼物，陪我跑两圈吧！\n快点啦快点啦，时间很紧的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ba540058c5d21a916ccfbc6611bfa49ae6003ed3f497d31c3bd6819007a2e33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1040",
        "10012"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
